{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>康萃樂成人益生菌150億膠囊30粒裝（Culturelle Health &amp; Wellness Probiotic）邊度買平？新假期整理萬寧、Market Place及龍豐共3間零售商的網店報價。以同款單盒標價計，最低與次低相差HK$113，約42%。</p>\n<h2>康萃樂成人益生菌150億膠囊30粒裝各網店報價</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>零售商</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒標價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜龍豐</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$155</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$155</strong></td>\n<td><strong>單盒標價</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>萬寧</td>\n<td>HK$268</td>\n<td>HK$268</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Market Place</td>\n<td>HK$276</td>\n<td>HK$276</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>康萃樂成人益生菌150億膠囊30粒裝單盒價錢點計？</h2>\n<p>買一盒康萃樂成人益生菌150億膠囊30粒裝，龍豐的同款網上標價為HK$155，較表列次低標價HK$268少HK$113。康萃樂成人益生菌150億膠囊30粒裝這個價差以單盒商品標價比較。若打算買多件，宜另計商戶的購買條件及結帳價。</p>\n<p>以上為2026年11月14日商戶網上報價，未計運費，價格、優惠及供應以商戶為準。網店來源：<a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/culturelle-health-wellness-probiotic-30-capsules/p/340299\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧</a><a href=\"https://www.marketplacehk.com/zh-hant/wellcome/p/%E5%BA%B7%E8%90%83%E6%A8%82LGMGM%E6%88%90%E4%BA%BA%E7%9B%8A%E7%94%9F%E8%8F%8C%2030%E7%B2%92/i/101342079.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Market Place</a><a href=\"https://eshop.lungfung.hk/product/mdn183599/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">龍豐</a></p>\n<p>這款配方含鼠李糖乳酪桿菌GG。益生菌是活微生物，不能將某一菌株的研究結果推及其他菌株或每位使用者。如對成分或服用有疑問，建議先諮詢醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士。<a href=\"https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/Probiotics-Consumer/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIH ODS：益生菌</a></p>\n<p>計算方法：（較高標價－較低標價）÷較高標價×100%。本次以（HK$268－HK$155）÷HK$268×100%計，約42%。上述比例未計運費及額外活動，亦不代表全港最低價、歷史低價或不同包裝版本的配方已完全核實一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463477285163249_5798573116af7f4155e27e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"康萃樂成人益生菌150億膠囊30粒裝格價：龍豐 HK$155，單盒約平42%\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463477285163249_5798573116af7f4155e27e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>點樣先可以用圖中價格買到康萃樂成人益生菌150億膠囊30粒裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>以2026年11月14日網上報價，龍豐的單盒商品總額為HK$155。條件為單盒標價，未計運費。</p>\n<p>今次格價比較哪一款包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>比較的是成人Health &amp; Wellness配方，標示150億活菌，每盒30粒。不包括其他菌數或兒童配方。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T06:00:30.447399+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":810,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T05:39:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:40.971706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T05:53:56.724534+00:00","content_hash":"2d1cedd8668c2de42d1a2dac0df9de60565216f5c6770825ca79c5a5f7542462","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}